---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Download" description="Lumen does not have a signed app release yet.">
  <div class="hero page-hero">
    <div class="hero-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Download</p>
    <h1 class="hero-enter">No signed release yet</h1>
    <p class="lead hero-enter" style="animation-delay: 160ms">
      There is no signed APK to download. When the minimum viable product milestone is reached, it
      will appear here.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="status-grid">
      <div class="status-card">
        <h3>What exists</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Onboarding, adaptive interface, and settings</li>
          <li>A screen for each of the eight modules, running real logic on sample input</li>
          <li>Automated tests and CI for the app</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="status-card pending">
        <h3>What is missing</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>A signed Android build and its release workflow</li>
          <li>Live camera, microphone, and sensor input</li>
          <li>Saved data between launches</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">In the meantime</p>
      <h2>Run it from source</h2>
      <p>
        With the <a href="https://docs.flutter.dev/get-started/install">Flutter SDK</a> installed and a
        device, emulator, or desktop target available:
      </p>
    </div>
    <pre class="code-block"><code>git clone https://github.com/lumen-assistive/lumen-app.git
cd lumen-app
flutter pub get
flutter run</code></pre>
    <p>
      The <a href="/docs/getting-started/running-the-app/">running the app</a> page explains what you
      will see and what is intentionally not there yet.
    </p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="button primary" href="https://github.com/lumen-assistive/lumen-app">lumen-app on GitHub</a>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/demo/">Try the browser demo</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
